# Quick check of the quiver (no video): leather, militia and fire-mage armour; the aim, the bow run, three gaits, sneaking. See quiver-mount.bench for the columns
cheat god
set time 12 0
view clean
goto NW_XARDAS_TOWER_VALLEY_091   # flat open ground
face -106                         # a rock behind, open in front
wait 500
manual on
equip ItRw_Bow_L_01
arrows player 20
insert Sheep
wait 300
pin SHEEP 1200 0 0
aimat SHEEP body
cam look 95
slowmo 2
tap bow
wait 1500
# quick check of the quiver (no video): see quiver-mount.bench
equip ITAR_Leather_L
arrows player 20
wait 400
press action
wait 700
rec q_lea_aim novideo
